# Graphometer Workbench — what this repo does NOT track.

# ── per-machine configuration ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Your paths (workspace root, excluded directories, port) are configuration,
# not product code. Never tracked, never shipped.
graphometer.env

# ── server-owned runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────
# The archive list — which sessions this machine hides from the rail. The
# `.tmp` is the atomic-write staging file.
graphometer-archive.json
graphometer-archive.json.tmp

# ── secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing credential-shaped has ever lived in this folder; this keeps it so.
# ~/.grok/auth.json is outside the tree and stays there.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
auth.json
credentials.json
*token*.json
*secret*
.netrc

# ── agent scratch space ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# studio/scratch/ is where the app points a session that chose no folder.
# Its contents are the agent's test output, not source.
studio/scratch/*
!studio/scratch/.gitkeep

# ── runtime junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
*.log
*.pid
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
